      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一时语塞。“秋古马三冠”。\n若想获得此称号，唯有称霸闪耀系列赛最顶尖的\n强者们云集的三场比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "0428c26aea48cb027b9742c5df8f6bb8b8f255e4c0b57b7d661f08f1b1b9f087",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
