      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唯有在“天皇赏（秋）”、“日本杯”，\n以及“有马纪念”全都夺冠一途。\n",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b02a1ac89d9c25662db9696aa80d7af9ba018404653acb3dcbe522e28af80ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
