      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "历史上曾经出现过无数英杰，然而直到此刻，\n只有唯一一位选手能够获得此称号──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c6b5fcc1489c06515daa7ec198ebe06d4757fc3ccb886dc4b52491d865599c3",
